irl, Subaru offers to help in her search, and later that night, he even finds the whereabouts of that which she seeks. But unbeknownst to them, a much darker force stalks the pair from the shadows, and just minutes after locating the insignia, Subaru and Satella are brutally murdered.\n\nHowever, Subaru immediately reawakens to a familiar scene—confronted by the same group of thugs, meeting Satella all over again—the enigma deepens as history inexplicably repeats itself.","releaseInfo":"2016","runtime":"25 min","imdbRating":"8.2","genres":[],"logo":"https://images.metahub.space/logo/medium/tt5607616/img","poster":"https://media.kitsu.app/anime/poster_images/11209/medium.jpg","background":"https://images.metahub.space/background/medium/tt5607616/img","trailers":[{"source":"IvhgOe9BY5A","type":"Trailer"}],"links":[{"name":"8.2","category":"imdb","url":"https://kitsu.io/anime/re-zero-kara-hajimeru-isekai-seikatsu"}]},{"id":"kitsu:49241","kitsu_id":"49241","imdb_id":"tt31889371","type":"series","animeType":"TV","name":"Tsue to Tsurugi no Wistoria 2nd Season","aliases":["Wistoria: Wand and Sword Season 2","Tsue to Tsurugi no Wistoria 2nd Season","Wistoria's Wand and Sword Season 2"],"description":"Second season of Tsue to Tsurugi no Wistoria.","releaseInfo":"2026","runtime":"24 min","imdbRating":"8.3","genres":[],"logo":"https://assets.fanart.tv/fanart/wistoria-wand-and-sword-69f2fe7cd7939.png","poster":"https://media.kitsu.app/anime/49241/poster_image/medium-74e27217fdbe71deef80561f7e8bd7da.jpeg","background":"https://assets.fanart.tv/fanart/wistoria-wand-and-sword-693278d3da558.jpg","trailers":[{"source":"SNTyXKD1r2s","type":"Trailer"}],"links":[{"name":"8.3","category":"imdb","url":"https://kitsu.io/anime/tsue-to-tsurugi-no-wistoria-2nd-season"}]},{"id":"kitsu:50187","kitsu_id":"50187","imdb_id":"tt9679542","type":"series","animeType":"TV","name":"Dr. STONE: SCIENCE FUTURE Part 3","aliases":["Dr. Stone: Science Future Part 3","Dr. STONE SCIENCE FUTURE Cour 3","Dr.STON